cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "inMotion: WiFi RSSI mobility classification for urban transport"
message: "If you use this code or dataset, please cite the dataset DOI and the relevant paper."
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-11"
license: null
type: software
abstract: >-
  Classification of passenger mobility (inside a bus, at the stop, boarding,
  alighting) from 10-second WiFi RSSI sequences captured by a fixed access
  point. Includes self-supervised world models (JEPA family, SIGReg),
  supervised deep-learning baselines, ensemble methods, and a live demo.
